{
	"name": "Bi-way: review request with routing",
	"nodes": [
		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "### How it works\nHelps shops, restaurants and service businesses collect reviews and hear about problems first. Every morning, the workflow reads yesterday's visits from a Google Sheet and asks each customer for a rating from 1 to 5, with RCS buttons or by SMS. A second entry point keeps only the ratings. Everyone who answers gets the link to your Google reviews; a 1 or 2 also gets an apology, and your team an email.\n\nKeep the link on both branches: Google does not allow asking only happy customers.\n\n**Limits:** RCS only reaches French mobile operators. Any lone figure from 1 to 5 counts as a rating, even without a recent request. A refused number does not stop the others. Running the request twice sends it twice.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the verified **Bi-way** community node (`n8n-nodes-biway-messenger`, [instructions](https://github.com/pocket-communication/n8n-nodes-biway-messenger#installation)). Tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.45.4 and n8n Cloud 3.1.0.\n2. Create a **Bi-Way API** credential with an API key from Bi-way › Settings › Security.\n3. Create a Google Sheet with a tab **Visits** and the columns `Date` (YYYY-MM-DD), `First name` and `Phone` (e.g. +33612345678), as **Plain text**. Add your Google Sheets credential and replace `YOUR_SHEET_ID`.\n4. Replace `https://g.page/r/YOUR_PLACE_ID/review` (four times) with your Google review link.\n5. Add an SMTP credential and replace `team@example.com`.\n6. RCS needs an agent launched by the French operators (check with RCS Agent › Get Status). Without one, set the Bi-way nodes to your SMS channel; buttons are left out.\n7. Your n8n must be reachable over HTTPS. Publish the workflow: the trigger registers its webhook by itself.\n\n### Customization\nChange the threshold in **Route by rating**. A fallback SMS written in the node holds 114 characters with the STOP mention and chat link; turn them off in **Fallback SMS Options** for up to 160.\n\n![Workflow overview](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pocket-communication/n8n-nodes-biway-messenger/main/examples/images/review-request-nodes.png#full-width)",
				"height": 1090,
				"width": 620
			},
			"id": "d6b95cd1-4d11-5817-94be-cf6365a6c6a8",
			"name": "Overview",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				-710,
				-130
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Ask for a rating\nRuns every morning for yesterday's visits. Five buttons by RCS, or an SMS asking for a figure from 1 to 5.",
				"height": 296,
				"width": 656,
				"color": 7
			},
			"id": "41640203-0bbc-5d07-8c0f-4623aa8cff0f",
			"name": "Section 1",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				-50,
				-130
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Keep only the ratings\nStarts on every received message. A tapped button or a single figure becomes a rating; anything else stops here.",
				"height": 296,
				"width": 686,
				"color": 7
			},
			"id": "f1cfae8b-42c8-5496-a5e0-e4271e47d1e6",
			"name": "Section 2",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				-50,
				230
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Answer every rating\nEveryone gets the review link. A 1 or 2 also gets an apology, and your team an email to contact them.",
				"height": 496,
				"width": 416,
				"color": 7
			},
			"id": "187ec012-dfa5-56d2-9946-3410f2ed13ce",
			"name": "Section 3",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				650,
				70
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"rule": {
					"interval": [
						{
							"field": "days",
							"triggerAtHour": 10
						}
					]
				}
			},
			"id": "3779bd8b-fb84-4d6e-a331-ef0231394214",
			"name": "Every day at 10 am",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
			"typeVersion": 1.2,
			"position": [
				0,
				0
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"documentId": {
					"__rl": true,
					"value": "YOUR_SHEET_ID",
					"mode": "id"
				},
				"sheetName": {
					"__rl": true,
					"value": "Visits",
					"mode": "name"
				},
				"filtersUI": {
					"values": [
						{
							"lookupColumn": "Date",
							"lookupValue": "={{ $now.minus({ days: 1 }).toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd') }}"
						}
					]
				},
				"options": {}
			},
			"id": "ec850e4a-e26a-43d5-adb8-9f1c38a48183",
			"name": "Get yesterday's visits",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
			"typeVersion": 4.5,
			"position": [
				220,
				0
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "message",
				"operation": "send",
				"channel": "rcs",
				"content": "text",
				"source": "raw",
